dlabel D_800EE7A4
    /* C9B54 800EE7A4 */ .asciz "-3-1TRAINING: -0PRESS -1DOWN OR THE -1%A% BUTTON TO PAGE THROUGH THE TRAINING TEXT. -2-4HI! MY NAME IS WHEELS. I WILL SHOW YOU SOME OF THE BASIC ELEMENTS NEEDED TO PLAY TETRISPHERE. -2-3THE DARK SHAPE OVER THE BALL IS THE -1SHADOW.-0IT SHOWS YOUR POSITION OVER THE BALL. -2-4-3YOU CAN MOVE THE -1SHADOW AROUND BY USING THE CONTROL PAD. -5-4-3-3NOTICE THAT THE SHADOW IS IN THE SHAPE OF THE -1CURRENT -1PIECE. -2-4WATCH AS THE SHADOW IS -1LINED -1UP WITH A -1MATCHING SHAPED PIECE. -5-4WHEN THE SHADOW IS -1LINED -1UP, THE PIECE THAT IT IS LINED UP WITH CAN BE MOVED. THIS IS CALLED -1SLIDING. -2-3TO SLIDE A PIECE: -0-11. LINE UP SHADOW -0-12. HOLD -1%B% BUTTON -0-13. MOVE PIECE -0-14. RELEASE BUTTON -5-4-1REMOVING -1PIECES: -0IN ORDER TO PASS LEVELS, PIECES MUST BE REMOVED FROM THE BALL. -2BEFORE A PIECE CAN BE REMOVED, YOU MUST FIRST -1LINE -1UP -1TWO MATCHING PIECES. -0THIS CAN BE DONE BY SLIDING. -5-3NOTICE THAT THE SHADOW -1CHANGES WHEN THE TWO PIECES LINE UP. -5-4-3NOW THAT TWO PIECES ARE LINED UP, A -1THIRD PIECE CAN BE -1ADDED BY PRESSING THE -1%A% BUTTON. -5-4-3NOW THAT A -1THIRD PIECE HAS BEEN ADDED AND -1LINES -1UP, THE PIECES WILL NOW BE REMOVED. -5-4OK! LET%S GO TO THE NEXT LEVEL!"
    /*  */
.align 2

.align 2
dlabel D_800EEC5C
    /* CA00C 800EEC5C */ .asciz "-3-1LIVES: -0THE SMALL RED HEARTS REPRESENT YOUR -1LIVES. -0NOTICE THAT YOU HAVE -1THREE LIVES. -2-4-3IF YOU DROP A PIECE AND YOU DO -1NOT HAVE -1TWO PIECES TOGETHER, YOU WILL -1LOSE A LIFE. -5-4-3NOTICE THAT A PIECE WAS -1STACKED ONTO THE BALL WHERE YOUR -1SHADOW WAS. -2-4-3-1GAME -1OBJECTIVE: -0THE OBJECT OF THE GAME IS TO -1UNCOVER A -1PICTURE THAT APPEARS ON THE -1CORE OF THE BALL. -2-4-3YOU DO THIS BY REMOVING -1ALL PIECES THAT OBSTRUCT THE PICTURE. -2-4WATCH AS THE PICTURE ON THE BALL IS UNCOVERED. -5REMEMBER THAT YOU MAY HAVE TO REMOVE PIECES -1SEVERAL LAYERS DEEP ON MOST LEVELS. -2GREAT! ON TO THE NEXT LEVEL!"
    /*  */
.align 2

.align 2
dlabel D_800EEED0
    /* CA280 800EEED0 */ .asciz "-1COMBOS: -0WHEN -1THREE OR MORE PIECES ARE REMOVED FROM THE BALL -1TOGETHER, THIS IS CALLED A -1COMBO. -2WATCH AS I SHOW YOU A COMBO OF SIX PIECES. -5-3NOTICE HOW THE NUMBER SIX APPEARS ON THE SCREEN.  THIS IS YOUR -1COMBO -1COUNTER. -2-4THE -1COMBO -1COUNTER TALLYS THE NUMBER OF PIECES BEING BROKEN IN ALL CURRENT COMBOS. -2-3COMBOS WITH LESS THAN -120 PIECES GIVE YOU -1POWER -1PIECES. -5-4-1POWER -1PIECES HAVE SPECIAL PROPERTIES. -0IF A -1COMBO IS -1STARTED WITH A POWER PIECE, THE COMBO TAKES -1LONGER TO FINISH. -2AN ADVANTAGE TO THIS IS THAT -1NEW COMBOS CAN BE STARTED -1DURING THAT TIME, GIVING YOU A -1LARGER COMBO COUNT. -2WATCH AS I SHOW YOU A -1POWER -1COMBO. -5ALL RIGHT! NOW TO THE LAST LEVEL!"
    /*  */
.align 2

.align 2
dlabel D_800EF198
    /* CA548 800EF198 */ .asciz "-1MAGIC: -0IF YOU MAKE A COMBO OF -120 OR MORE PIECES, YOU GET A -1MAGIC POWER UP. -5-3NOTICE THE -1ICON THAT APPEARED AFTER THE COMBO. -0THIS SHOWS YOU YOUR -1MAGIC. -2-4MAGIC HELPS TO REMOVE -1MANY PIECES FROM THE BALL VERY -1QUICKLY. -2-3USE THE -1%C#% BUTTON TO USE YOUR MAGIC. -5-4THIS IS THE END OF BASICS TRAINING! -0-1CONGRATULATIONS! -0NOW YOU ARE READY FOR -1TETRISPHERE!"
    /*  */
.align 2

.align 2
dlabel D_800EF318
    /* CA6C8 800EF318 */ .asciz "-3-1CRYSTAL -1PIECES: -0CRYSTAL PIECES CAN BE FOUND ALL AROUND THE BALL IN A LEVEL. -2-4IF THE SHADOW COVERS A GROUP OF CRYSTAL PIECES, THEY CAN BE TURNED INTO A -1POWER -1PIECE IN THE SHAPE OF THE SHADOW. -2-3THIS IS DONE USING THE -1%B% BUTTON. -5-4NOW TO THE NEXT LEVEL FOR SOME MORE ADVANCED TECHNIQUES!"
    /*  */
.align 2

.align 2
dlabel D_800EF44C
    /* CA7FC 800EF44C */ .asciz "-3-1X -1COUNT: -0THE NUMBER THAT APPEARS IN THE COLORED BOX IS CALLED YOUR -1X -1COUNT. -2-4THE X COUNT IS A -1MULTIPLIER VALUE USED FOR YOUR COMBO SCORE. -2IT ALSO -1INCREASES THE AMOUNT OF PIECES -1SENT TO YOUR OPPONENT IN VS GAMES. -2THERE ARE MANY WAYS TO INCREASE YOUR X COUNT. -0DOING -1GRAVITY -1COMBOS IS ONE WAY. -2-1GRAVITY -1COMBOS: -0WHEN A PIECE FALLS BECAUSE OF -1GRAVITY, IT CAN CAUSE A COMBO. -2HERE I WILL SET UP A SIMPLE -1GRAVITY -1COMBO. -5-3NOTICE THAT THE PIECE ON TOP WILL -1FALL IF THE PIECE UNDERNEATH IS MOVED. -5-4-3SINCE THE PIECE THAT FELL CREATES A COMBO, THOSE PIECES WILL BREAK. -5-4-3NOTICE ALSO THAT THE GRAVITY COMBO -1INCREASED YOUR -1X -1COUNT. -2-4GRAVITY COMBOS CAN BE USED TO GIVE YOU UP TO -1TEN X COUNT POWER UPS! -2GREAT! LET%S DO THE LAST ADVANCED TRAINING LEVEL!"
    /*  */
.align 2

.align 2
dlabel D_800EF774
    /* CAB24 800EF774 */ .asciz "-1FUSE -1COMBOS: -0WHEN A PIECE BREAKS IN A COMBO, IT -1FLASHES. -0THIS IS CALLED A -1FUSE. -5-3A FUSE FROM A -1POWER -1COMBO CAN BE MOVED BY SLIDING. -5-4-3IF YOU SLIDE A FUSE TO LINE UP WITH -1TWO OR MORE OTHER PIECES, THEN THIS NEW COMBO WILL BREAK. -2THIS IS CALLED A -1FUSE -1COMBO. -5-4-3FUSE COMBOS ALSO CAN GIVE YOU UP TO -1TEN X COUNT POWER UPS. -2-4ALL RIGHT! NOW YOU ARE DONE WITH ADVANCED TRAINING!"
    /*  */
.align 2

